opencc-kmp

This project is a Kotlin Multiplatform adaptation of Open Chinese Convert (OpenCC).
OpenCC is Copyright 2010-2026 Carbo Kuo and contributors, licensed under Apache-2.0.
Reference: https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC/tree/ver.1.4.2

The pinned source archive contains LICENSE and AUTHORS but no top-level NOTICE file.
AUTHORS is reproduced without modification. Kotlin adaptations of OpenCC algorithms
and redistributed dictionaries retain the upstream licence and attribution.

No native OpenCC or its third-party libraries are linked into the Kotlin runtime.
Build-time reference tools use their own upstream third-party licence notices.

The Kotlin MARISA image reader adapts layout and restoration algorithms from MARISA,
Copyright (c) 2010-2025 Susumu Yata, used under the BSD 2-clause licence option.
The upstream licence text is reproduced in licenses/marisa.txt and must accompany
artifacts containing this adaptation.

The Kotlin Darts builder adapts Darts-clone, Copyright (c) 2008-2014 Susumu Yata,
under BSD-2-Clause. See licenses/darts-clone.txt for the retained licence notice.

The optional Kotlin Jieba segmentation module adapts cppjieba, Copyright (c) 2013,
under the MIT licence. See licenses/CPPJIEBA-LICENSE for its retained notice.

CLI argument/help output adapts TCLAP, Copyright (c) 2003-2012 Michael E. Smoot,
2004-2016 Daniel Aarno and 2017 Google LLC, under MIT. See licenses/tclap.txt.
